>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/8173/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-07-03 15:12:52] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:12:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:12:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178441658,"discussion_id":"7f3af132f7c9a4dba89ec4a0e04b17e484123b49","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `MoeInitRoutingV3` 算子在部分场景下的精度失败问题。问题源于 `MoeV3GatherStaticQuant` 模板类的 `Init` 方法中，`floatQueue_` 缓冲区的初始化大小计算未考虑输入数据类型 `T` 的对齐要求，导致缓冲区空间不足或未对齐，进而影响计算精度。修复方法是在计算缓冲区大小时，先按 `sizeof(T)` 对 `perLoopCols_` 进行对齐，再乘以 `sizeof(float)`，确保缓冲区大小满足对齐约束。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`floatQueue_` 缓冲区大小计算对齐修正**：在 `moe/moe_init_routing_v3/op_kernel/arch35/moe_v3_gather_static_quant.h` 的 `Init` 方法中，将 `floatQueue_` 的缓冲区大小从 `AlignBytes(perLoopCols_, sizeof(float))` 改为 `AlignBytes(Align(perLoopCols_, sizeof(T)), sizeof(float))`，先按输入类型 `T` 的大小对齐列数，避免因对齐不当导致的精度问题。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:23:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:23:24+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178452459,"discussion_id":"0e33ec697fb4d04867590134aa1d44c01c40c86f","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:56:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:56:18+08:00","user":{"id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","login":"guoqiuhao","object_id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","name":"Guoqh","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guoqiuhao"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178484615,"discussion_id":"ed5a58ccc404f0f4701a910f8eeb56a202c757a5","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-07-03T17:31:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:31:45+08:00","user":{"id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","login":"cpy_123456","object_id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","name":"cpy_123456","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cpy_123456"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]